  because it's good because change is  painful  right if you're in a painful spot you'll  take the pain  because that's nothing compared to the  crappy life you're living now  but if your life is good making a change  is pain and  i don't want to do that so good is the  enemy of great  and so sometimes people need that really  painful point like you did in your life  to realize how you can change and grow  and we may have to go through that  to get to where we need to go the second  way i found to be really helpful is just  be an example because  ramming something down somebody's throat  that that doesn't work  tell them you need to do this you need  to do it's not going to work right  imagine if somebody's giving that to you  you're not going to be receptive to it a  great way i found is to just  be an example if you're living a happy  life now  you know you love what you do you have  energy you're following your passion  you're a happy person you will attract  people to you  right people like being around happy  positive  energetic people people don't like  hanging around the guys who are always  down on life  and telling you how everything's going  to fail right the little man nobody  likes hanging around the little man  so be the happy energetic person and you  will attract people to you  who will want to know your secret and  who want to live like you  you know i share the stuff that i do  right i like to go snowboarding like to  go salsa dancing  and it's inspired other people to do  those things too  and to take action on those personal  interests but also  on the business advice that i give right  when i'm talking it's positive it's  upbeat it's energetic  i'm not coming on saying yeah i gotta go  salsa dancing  whatever that's not gonna inspire  anything  so you have to be positive upbeat and  you are like if you're happy with your  life right now you will attract other  people  the third thing i found is  help people see  the greater picture help people believe  in themselves more  that's what this is where this comes  from right belief  a lot of people have such limiting  beliefs  and they see greatness in other people  but they don't see it in themselves they  don't see how they could do something  great but they see it in other people  so just help people see the greatness  inside of them and what they could  become  i have a friend of mine bailey who is an  entrepreneur has a successful company  and now he's looking to she's got to do  something else with her life she's  looking to get to the next step and  and she's changing and evolving she  doesn't know what it looks like she  doesn't know what she's going to do  so she's experimenting with a lot of  different things like a lot of us can  relate to that where you're  you've done something for a certain  amount of time and then you start  getting bored  and you don't know what to do next and  she's taking the courage to go out and  just try a whole bunch of different  stuff and i said bailey you got to  document  this you got to put these on videos you  got to put it on youtube  you got to talk about it because your  journey  will inspire millions of people  with her ability to connect with people  and her courage to take this step where  most people  they wouldn't do it because she has a  good life she's going for great  most people wouldn't take that step you  will inspire millions of people  and she doesn't she didn't believe it  right she's like ah nobody's gonna watch  he sings nobody cares my stuff is crap  but we all think what we make  videos especially are just crap at the  start  and she put up a video and somebody  commented on it  and said i forget what the comment was  like go bailey or you're an inspiration  or something like that and she's  because of that one comment now spending  more time  on her videos right she's actually  preparing instead of just sitting down  and talking about whatever comes to her  mind she's actually preparing for it  and the videos are gonna get better and  it's like bailey  you will inspire millions of people this  is gonna happen  and it's gonna come from people watching  your videos so you have to make them  better  right and as the message gets repeated  and she starts to see progress and  momentum she starts to believe it more  where she never would have thought that  she would help so many people but i see  a clear picture for her and she's going  to get there  and so believing in people and showing  them  how they could be much greater  and helping them believe in themselves  more just having one person  who believes in you can make the  difference but if you're surrounded by  people who just  pound on you and put you back in place  and tell you how things aren't going to  work you know the little man  just having one person say  i believe in you that can make the  difference  and so you could be that person to sum  it all up though  you have to remember that it's their  life  right it's their life and no matter how  badly you want it for them  they still have to live their life right  it's still  on them you could be the greatest  motivator  the greatest inspiration the greatest  you know shining a positive light on  people but it's still  at the end of the day up to them to  change their life  and forcing them isn't going to work all  you can do is plant seeds  you plant seeds you plant ideas and you  try to water them and try to grow them  and some people react  really quickly and will scoop up  everything you're saying and take  immediate action  and for some people it may take years  may take years for them to come back so  you know what what that dieter guy  said it's starting to make sense  so don't get frustrated i know you want  to help everybody  really quickly i see it too i help  entrepreneurs some people pick it up and  scoop it and they're running others are  are just floundering around like i gave  you the end what i gave you the answer  what are you doing go  i told you what to do it's gonna work  and they  just some people have to go at their own  pace  and that's okay but i love what you're  doing  i love that you're trying to help people  and um  and i'm inspired by your success story  as well so believe  everybody watching thumbs up below if  you liked it let me know what you think  leave a comment ask me a question below  and if you want to see more videos like  this click on my face  subscribe to the channel thank you so  much and i'll see you soon

